Data sources

TreasureIQ ingests data published by Italian public administrations. That data
belongs to the bodies that publish it and is not covered by this licence:

  Comune di Albano Laziale — service catalogue, retrieved from the Design
  Comuni Italia WordPress REST API at comune.albanolaziale.rm.it.

Snapshots of that data are committed under data/seed/ so the application can be
run without network access. They are a point-in-time copy for demonstration and
may not reflect what the comune currently publishes; the authoritative source
is always the comune's own page, which every result in the interface links to.

---

Eligibility results

This software reports whether the data a comune published is sufficient to
establish eligibility. It does not decide entitlement and it is not an official
channel of any public administration. Where criteria are absent or stated only
in prose, the interface says so rather than guessing, and directs the reader to
the comune's published page.
